<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 23.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 23.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				April 23	     April 22</p>
<p>Fed acct			15.463		 14.137</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  34.530		 27.665</p>
<p>Cash balance		  50.393		 41.802</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,259.098	     5,254.303</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $10 million were issued and $21 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
